{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And you shall not profane My holy name.</b> Since you see My work toward this perfection, you who are consecrated to walk in My ways — do not profane My holy name through deficient and disgraceful deeds, in the manner of וַיָּבֹא אֶל הַגּוֹיִם אֲשֶׁר בָּאוּ שָׁמָּה וַיְחַלְּלוּ אֶת שֵׁם קָדְשִׁי (Ezekiel 36:20)." "<b>And I will be sanctified among the children of Israel.</b> To perform wonders for them, as I vowed when I said: הִנֵּה אָנֹכִי כֹּרֵת בְּרִית נֶגֶד כָּל עַמְּךָ אֶעֱשֶׂה נִפְלָאוֹת (Exodus 34:10). And the reason for this is that indeed <b>I am YHWH who sanctifies you.</b>"], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:25.272125738Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}